 capture service for event ingestion", "Includes the plugin server (posthog-node) as a service distinct from web and worker", "Includes Temporal", "Provides ReplicatedMergeTree coordination (ClickHouse Keeper or ZooKeeper)", "Pins the application and plugin server to the same commit or tag", "Does not present a broker-less stack as sufficient for ingestion"]}') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
